{"sections":{"image_banner_FFUz3g":{"type":"image-banner","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/header_algemeen-2200-434-2.jpg","image_overlay_opacity":0,"image_height":"adapt","desktop_content_position":"middle-left","show_text_box":false,"desktop_content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"scheme-579d144e-d1e4-457d-afdf-2daa64086404","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"center","stack_images_on_mobile":true,"show_text_below":true}},"rich_text_4NpR7L":{"type":"rich-text","settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"scheme-579d144e-d1e4-457d-afdf-2daa64086404","full_width":true,"padding_top":8,"padding_bottom":0}},"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"custom_css":["\/* Custom CSS for H1 Styling *\/h1 {color: #bf1e2d; \/* Maakt de tekst rood *\/ font-size: 24px; \/* Verandert de grootte van de tekst *\/}"],"settings":{"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":0}},"rich_text_rLayEk":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_4dwRgH":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Services","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_pJBVkP":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Fendertec provides all kinds of services on rubber fenders. To comply with fast delivery we can do operations on rubber fenders in our own production area. The guillotine is used to cut marine fenders into the required lengths.<\/p><p>Drilling holes into rubber marine fenders is possible in all kinds of shapes. Standard fenders, such as D section fenders, Delta fenders and more fenders, are predrilled and deliverable out of stock. Customer specific fenders with drilled holes have short delivery terms. Production of the rubber products is in compliance with ISO9001 certification.<\/p><p>Do you have questions regarding our operations on rubber fenders? Don’t hesitate to contact our sales office.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_4dwRgH","text_pJBVkP"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"left","content_alignment":"left","color_scheme":"","full_width":true,"padding_top":32,"padding_bottom":16}},"image_with_text_heCwXX":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_6nFexp":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Drilling & cutting of rubber fenders","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_B6ANJy":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Rubber marine fenders can be cut, bevelled, and drilled into custom shapes. Standard fenders like D-section are predrilled in stock. Custom fenders have short lead times.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_6nFexp","text_B6ANJy"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/service-boren-zagen.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","section_color_scheme":"scheme-1","color_scheme":"scheme-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":16}},"image_with_text_94d9hQ":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_T9xaei":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Pre-curved cornerbends","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_RAmwkq":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>FenderTec specializes in pre-curved corner bends for rubber fenders. We offer custom rubber qualities and radii to meet customer needs. Contact our sales team.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_T9xaei","text_RAmwkq"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/service-hoekstukken.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"scheme-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":16,"padding_bottom":16}},"image_with_text_DTXFyf":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_4kMwKE":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Fenders on stock for repair market","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_fn8idr":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>FenderTec supplies marine rubber fenders globally, focusing on fast delivery for repairs. We offer standard fenders with short lead times and worldwide shipping.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_4kMwKE","text_fn8idr"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/service-vervangen-reparatie.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"scheme-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":16,"padding_bottom":16}},"image_with_text_4VQjxc":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_xAUxBX":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Central stock rubber fenders","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_yLyV7F":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>FenderTec supplies rubber fenders from stock, with a central warehouse near Rotterdam ensuring fast delivery across Europe and offering custom solutions.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_xAUxBX","text_yLyV7F"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/service-voorraad.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"scheme-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":16,"padding_bottom":16}},"image_with_text_YMNjpg":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_HXTcz3":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Worldwide shipping rubber fenders","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_KBcCFK":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>FenderTec, located near the Port of Rotterdam, provides top-quality rubber fenders with fast shipping, short lead times, and custom solutions worldwide.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_HXTcz3","text_KBcCFK"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/service-worldwide.png","height":"adap